#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_increased_first_year
msgid ""
"Czech Republic only, groups 1–3, and only for the FIRST depreciator (§ 31 odst. 6: the first to acquire the asset new and unused, or who built it). Straight-line uses the § 31 odst. 1 písm. b)–d) tables; accelerated adds the percentage of the entry price to the first-year charge (§ 32 odst. 2 písm. a)).\n"
"+10 %: any group 1–3 asset (§ 31 odst. 4).\n"
"+15 %: only water-treatment equipment CZ-CPA 28.29.12 used in buildings CZ-CC 125113, and sorting and processing equipment for secondary raw materials (§ 31 odst. 3).\n"
"+20 %: only agricultural and forestry machines CZ-CPA 28.3 of a taxpayer with mainly agricultural and forestry production (§ 31 odst. 2).\n"
"Never for aircraft, motorcycles and passenger cars outside the licensed uses, household appliances (CZ-CPA 27.5) or recreational boats (CZ-CPA 30.12) — § 31 odst. 5. Odoo cannot see these conditions; the choice is yours to justify."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_in_service_date_override
msgid ""
