"Defaults to the accounting depreciation start; override it when migrating an"
" asset whose tax depreciation started on another date."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_entry_value
msgid ""
