#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_vehicle_capped
msgid ""
"Passenger vehicle subject to the statutory vehicle limit set on the company."
" CZ §30e (2 000 000 CZK, category M1): only the share limit / entry price of"
" each depreciation is deductible, so the tax board is computed on the limit."
" SK §17(34) (48 000 EUR): the car is depreciated in full and the board "
"shows, per year, the excess over straight-line depreciation of 48 000 EUR — "
"the amount added back to the tax base only when that base is lower than the "
"statutory threshold."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_method_locked
msgid ""
"Set once the first tax depreciation is filed. The statutory method may not "
"change for the asset's whole life (CZ §30(2) / SK §26(3))."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_asset_tax_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset_tax_oca.field_account_asset__tax_sk_disposal_months
msgid ""
"Slovakia, §22(12): keep the depreciation for the whole months the asset was "
"recorded in the year it is disposed of. Mandatory for assets depreciated "
"under §26(6) and (7); optional (from 2016) for assets whose residual value "
"is deductible only up to the sale proceeds under §19(3)(b) first point — "
"passenger cars, boats, aircraft, motorcycles, bicycles, group-6 buildings "
"sold. Every other asset gets no tax depreciation in the year of disposal "
"(§22(11)); its residual value is expensed instead."
msgstr ""

